  <url type="vcs-browser">https://git.yellowkeycard.net/outrider/f2bgl</url>
  <description>
    <p>f2bgl is a rewrite of the engine used in the game Fade To Black made by Delphine Software.</p>
    <p>It is designed as a cross-platform replacement for the original DOS executable.</p>
  </description>
